25	2	25	Les entêtes envoyés par le serveur spécifient la politique de communication des referrers.	Pour chaque page du site, configurer le serveur pour envoyer l'entête HTTP Referrer-Policy avec comme valeur, par ordre de préférence :\n- no-referrer\n- same-origin\n- strict-origin\n- strict-origin-when-cross-origin	Vérifier pour chaque page du site, la présence de l'entête HTTP Referrer-Policy avec comme valeur, par ordre de préférence :\n- no-referrer\n- same-origin\n- strict-origin\n- strict-origin-when-cross-origin	statique	Les en-têtes HTTP de réponse, dont Referrer-Policy, sont directement lisibles via une requête HTTP standard sans exécution JavaScript ni interaction navigateur.	ia_import	\N	Interrogez un échantillon représentatif de pages du site via des requêtes HTTP pour lire les en-têtes de réponse du serveur. Vérifiez pour chaque page la présence de l'en-tête Referrer-Policy et sa valeur exacte parmi : no-referrer, same-origin, strict-origin, strict-origin-when-cross-origin. Signalez toute page où cet en-tête est absent ou possède une valeur non conforme.	kimi-k2.6	[0.014457703,0.06011963,-0.033203125,-0.05783081,0.013427734,-0.008773804,-0.051635742,-0.02619934,-0.0009717941,0.033447266,0.06439209,-0.031341553,-0.03010559,-0.038085938,-0.016281128,-0.0015201569,0.0028915405,-0.0030326843,0.01486969,0.02468872,0.053588867,-0.00969696,-0.050628662,0.028381348,-0.004924774,-0.022125244,0.027740479,0.007183075,0.031219482,-0.048339844,0.0115737915,-0.032989502,0.031341553,0.031341553,0.00667572,0.0036239624,-0.002773285,-0.02456665,0.027267456,0.042053223,-0.0037021637,0.012321472,0.028747559,0.0032367706,-0.029922485,-0.014389038,-0.00869751,-0.03036499,0.03604126,0.026000977,-0.014205933,0.00076818466,-0.005420685,0.028915405,-0.031463623,0.020477295,-0.03427124,0.017333984,0.0029678345,0.008331299,0.036193848,-0.019577026,-0.027236938,-0.00029993057,-0.009902954,0.036987305,-0.023590088,0.0034046173,0.06323242,0.027679443,0.029769897,0.012321472,-0.020736