,0.044036865,-0.018951416,0.02168274,-0.017150879,0.042266846,-0.011421204,0.027023315,0.008361816,0.0031833649,-0.008430481,-0.01927185,0.02154541,-0.020523071,0.02142334,0.022888184,-0.034301758,0.009414673,-0.024108887,-0.0027217865,5.507469e-05,0.02104187,-0.007534027,0.029556274,0.020889282,0.019256592,0.022109985,-0.03302002,-0.015991211,-0.04434204,-0.031066895,0.008766174,-0.025650024,-0.0008172989,-0.00749588,-0.037902832,0.01361084,-0.0015830994,0.02658081,-0.012939453,0.027404785,-0.008926392,0.029251099,0.011940002,0.0008363724]	Le panier permet d’avoir une vue d’ensemble de ce que l’on va commander. C’est le moment par excellence où l’utilisateur peut avoir besoin de vérifier sa commande. Dans ce cas, le fait de pouvoir consulter le détail directement dans le panier ou à partir du panier est un vrai avantage.	6	2026-08-02 18:48:14.927257	2026-09-09 11:48:23.301303	\N	\N	\N
193	11	193	Les fonctionnalités de zoom ne sont pas bloquées.	Ne pas utiliser de mécanisme bloquant le zoom, et en particulier, ne pas utiliser les attributs minimum-scale, maximum-scale et user-scalable de l’élément meta viewport.	Vérifier sur un périphérique tactile qu’il est possible d’agrandir la vue avec la commande de zoom tactile du navigateur.	statique	L'attribut content de la balise meta viewport contient directement les déclarations qui bloquent le zoom (user-scalable=no, maximum-scale, minimum-scale) ; leur présence ou absence est vérifiable par simple inspection du DOM sans interaction tactile ni exécution JavaScript.	ia_import	\N	Pour chaque page auditée, inspectez le DOM à la recherche de la balise <meta name="viewport">. Analysez la valeur de son attribut content pour détecter toute occurrence de user-scalable=no ou de maximum-scale/minimum-scale restreignant le zoom utilisateur. Si ces attributs bloquants sont présents, signalez la non-conformité. Si la balise est absente, considérez la page conforme sur ce point, l'absence de méta viewport ne bloquant pas nativement le zoom navigateur.	kimi-k2.6	[0.036895752,0.1048584,-0.034851074,-0.027633667,-0.009681702,-0.030456543,-0.047851562,-0.022079468,-0.008010864,0.02067566,0.036010742,-0.046081543,-0.034606934,0.022583008,0.0019664764,0.03274536,-0.010536194,-0.0317688,0.04232788,0.016326904,0.076416016,-0.019546509,0.0044517517,-0.0064353943,-0.03237915,-0.031173706,-0.006149292,0.001917839,0.02911377,0.03704834,0.02078247,-0.04522705,0.011100769,0.0023765564,-0.005180359,-0.04168701,0.005706787,-0.030258179,0.014122009,0.020065308,0.0029125214,-0.008605957,0.024398804,0.0037631989,-0.010192871,0.013175964,0.021591187,0.00078582764,-0.011924744,0.034606934,-0.0046958923,0.025482178,0.012954712,0.0023880005,-0.008857727,-0.027053833,-0.020446777,-0.010864258,0.0015048981,0.02079773,0.017196655,-0.008140564,0.011978149,0.008201599,-0.015113831,0.058807373,-0.032592773,-0.02935791,0.016403198,-0.04324341,0.