129	7	129	Le pays est précisé pour toutes les adresses postales.	Indiquer explicitement le pays dans l'adresse postale sous forme textuelle.	Pour chaque adresse postale indiquée dans le site :\n- Vérifier la présence de la mention textuelle et explicite du pays dans toutes les adresses postales.	statique	La mention textuelle du pays dans les adresses postales est directement vérifiable par parsing du DOM et analyse textuelle via regex, sans nécessiter d'interaction navigateur ni d'appréciation visuelle.	ia_import	\N	Crawler un échantillon représentatif de pages du site. Identifiez les adresses postales en ciblant les éléments sémantiques (<address>, schema.org/PostalAddress) ou via des regex détectant les patterns d'adresse (code postal, rue, ville). Pour chaque adresse identifiée, vérifiez que son contenu textuel comporte explicitement le nom du pays (ex. 'France', 'Belgique'). Signalez toute adresse postale qui ne mentionne pas le pays de façon explicite.	kimi-k2.6	[0.0046691895,0.02709961,-0.00086021423,-0.0055236816,-0.029067993,-0.03677368,-0.043060303,0.0042686462,-0.013420105,0.044006348,0.026397705,-0.017333984,-0.02104187,-0.024902344,0.002292633,0.038848877,-0.008056641,0.015655518,-0.002494812,-0.018981934,0.08703613,-0.034851074,-0.019195557,0.013496399,0.04260254,0.0056152344,-0.019577026,0.010818481,0.04852295,-0.0026664734,0.016967773,-0.0211792,0.014915466,0.023834229,-0.033081055,-0.016815186,-0.031555176,0.017425537,0.05908203,0.014892578,0.005771637,-0.0074005127,0.04534912,-0.0259552,-0.057922363,0.015792847,-0.0032577515,0.003824234,0.02859497,0.028305054,0.018966675,0.0065841675,0.009422302,-0.0046310425,-0.0075187683,-0.045166016,0.0026817322,0.018600464,0.01725769,-0.0068588257,0.011001587,-0.016326904,0.00749588,-0.0058250427,-0.006454468,0.04647827,-0.04095459,0.015113831,0.02268982,0.005027771,0.0032138824,0.023529053,0.020858765,-0.025924683,-0.031921387,-0.02935791,-0.014877319,0.04675293,-0.037261963,-0.07269287,-0.04006958,-0.01751709,