207	12	207	Le serveur indique le type MIME de chaque ressource.	Configurer le serveur pour adresser pour chaque ressource (texte, image, script, etc.) l’en-tête ContentType renseigné avec le type MIME approprié, par exemple :\ntext/html ;application/pdf.	Vérifier, à l’aide d’un outil d’inspection des en-têtes HTTP, la présence de ContentType avec la valeur correspondant au type de ressource.	statique	Les en-têtes HTTP Content-Type sont retournés par le serveur et vérifiables via une simple requête réseau sans exécution JavaScript ni interaction navigateur.	ia_import	\N	Crawlez un échantillon représentatif de pages et de ressources du site (HTML, CSS, JS, images, PDF, vidéos, etc.). Pour chaque ressource récupérée, inspectez les en-têtes de réponse HTTP et vérifiez la présence et la pertinence de l'en-tête Content-Type (par exemple text/html pour HTML, text/css pour CSS, image/jpeg pour JPEG, application/pdf pour PDF). Signalez toute ressource dépourvue d'en-tête Content-Type ou dont la valeur ne correspond pas au type réel de la ressource servie.	kimi-k2.6	[0.0038166046,0.06854248,-0.015579224,-0.056793213,0.0056037903,-0.05230713,-0.03363037,-0.02909851,0.0029563904,0.024871826,0.019500732,-0.019500732,-0.011810303,-0.0064735413,-0.005508423,-0.004573822,0.014640808,0.008804321,0.027023315,0.010757446,0.07141113,-0.0022525787,-0.058624268,0.021987915,0.0062217712,-0.0044555664,0.031204224,0.029403687,0.057739258,-0.00017035007,-0.006095886,-0.036987305,0.047210693,0.02128601,0.019866943,-0.042266846,0.013618469,-0.008895874,0.026626587,-0.011291504,0.004524231,0.028427124,0.013114929,-0.024353027,-0.022033691,-0.025802612,0.0011663437,-0.008880615,0.009223938,0.0051574707,0.0011911392,0.023498535,-0.004722595,0.042510986,-0.028823853,0.003993988,-0.044281006,0.041809082,-0.021057129,-0.028533936,0.060760498,0.018844604,-0.03817749,-0.012023926,-0.01083374,0.018600464,-0.042877197,-0.042114258,0.025894165,0.010070801,0.011817932,0.005821228,-0.0005464554,-0.02413940