191	11	191	Les styles ne justifient pas le texte.	Ne pas utiliser la propriété CSS text-align avec la valeur justify, ou tout autre équivalent.\nEn savoir plus:text-alignsur MDN	Vérifier dans le code CSS l’absence de règles text-align : justify.\nVérifier dans le code HTML l’absence d’attributs HTML align="justify".	statique	L'attribut HTML align="justify" et la déclaration CSS text-align: justify sont lisibles directement dans le code source HTML et les feuilles de style (internes, inline ou externes liées), sans aucune exécution JavaScript ni interaction utilisateur.	ia_import	\N	Crawlez un échantillon représentatif de pages du site. Pour chaque page, inspectez le DOM statique et l'ensemble des feuilles de style associées (balises <style>, attributs style en ligne, fichiers CSS externes) pour y rechercher la présence de la déclaration CSS text-align: justify. Vérifiez également dans le DOM statique l'absence d'attributs HTML align="justify". Signalez chaque occurrence identifiée, qu'elle provienne du HTML ou du CSS.	kimi-k2.6	[0.02633667,0.062683105,-0.038330078,-0.048217773,0.024490356,-0.0340271,-0.046875,-0.026290894,-0.0065078735,0.042144775,0.05355835,-0.028671265,-0.0027713776,0.009590149,0.0014686584,0.06652832,-0.00084638596,-0.03955078,0.008766174,0.026687622,0.008460999,0.004890442,-0.013542175,0.024505615,0.02268982,0.006225586,-0.0026302338,0.022415161,0.04537964,0.014312744,0.0054359436,-0.032348633,0.012908936,0.00831604,-0.00806427,0.016296387,0.005264282,-0.028366089,0.049987793,0.0053100586,-0.0049819946,-0.0022392273,0.029281616,-0.025100708,-0.004371643,0.030578613,0.05697632,0.016967773,0.011482239,0.040649414,-0.006427765,0.057678223,0.025314331,0.022705078,-0.0064353943,-0.037017822,-0.064697266,0.004802704,0.0006117821,-0.037597656,0.074035645,0.0052375793,-0.009185791,0.0063667297,-0.043640137,0.0234375,-0.009765625,-0.06262207,0.00819397,-0.055908203,0.023834229,-0.00050497055,0.0013113022,0.018707275,-0.030334473,-0.062927246,0.01335144,0