206	12	206	Les entêtes envoyés par le serveur désactivent la détection automatique du type MIME de chaque ressource.	Configurer le serveur pour adresser l’en-tête X-Content-Type-Options avec la valeur nosniff.	Vérifier, à l’aide d’un outil d’inspection des en-têtes HTTP, la présence de l’en-tête X-Content-Type-Options avec la valeur nosniff.	statique	La présence et la valeur exacte de l'en-tête HTTP X-Content-Type-Options sont vérifiables directement dans la réponse du serveur sans exécution JavaScript ni interaction navigateur.	ia_import	\N	Interrogez le serveur pour récupérer les en-têtes HTTP des réponses de chaque page et ressource auditée (HTML, CSS, JS, médias, etc.). Vérifiez la présence de l'en-tête X-Content-Type-Options avec la valeur exacte nosniff. Signalez chaque ressource dont l'en-tête est absent ou dont la valeur diffère de nosniff.	kimi-k2.6	[0.015258789,0.08380127,-0.014633179,-0.07232666,-0.012619019,-0.04244995,-0.03652954,-0.021057129,0.00724411,0.016235352,0.033935547,-0.019332886,-0.033325195,-0.0015010834,-0.030929565,0.009750366,0.017486572,0.0158844,0.02418518,0.032165527,0.066101074,0.026443481,-0.04510498,0.0047569275,0.018188477,-0.013900757,0.02507019,0.008628845,0.085510254,-0.0034427643,-0.030593872,-0.043701172,0.0390625,0.030822754,0.021118164,-0.032348633,0.010421753,-0.013801575,0.0005121231,-0.0019683838,0.0095825195,-0.0022125244,0.009994507,0.007865906,-0.04031372,-0.01058197,0.029846191,-0.010040283,0.010559082,0.0021247864,-0.00037026405,0.026504517,-0.016738892,0.0552063,-0.03942871,-0.0010929108,-0.017486572,0.0345459,-0.02645874,-0.010032654,0.04034424,-0.0025138855,-0.03744507,-0.0016002655,0.007106781,0.032562256,-0.05429077,-0.04525757,0.016601562,0.010131836,-0.006149292,0.00970459,0.018356323,-0.031982422,-0.010398865,-0.051574707,-0.0126953125,0.010437012,-0.018692017,-0.016601562,0.0031871796,0.027740479,-0.039489746,-0.009239197,0.006137848,-0.025177002,-0.099975586,0.035095215,-0.034973145,0.024124146,-0.016799927