210	12	210	Le serveur envoie les informations d'activation de protection cross site scripting.	Configurer le serveur pour l’envoi de l’entête HTTP X-XSS-Protection avec la valeur 1; mode=block.	Vérifier, à l’aide d’un outil d’inspection des en-têtes HTTP, la présence de X-XSS-Protection avec la valeur 1; mode=block.	statique	La présence et la valeur de l'en-tête de réponse HTTP X-XSS-Protection sont directement inspectables via une simple requête réseau sans exécution JavaScript ni interaction navigateur.	ia_import	\N	Effectuez une requête HTTP (HEAD ou GET) vers un échantillon représentatif de pages du site audité, ou utilisez un crawler pour collecter les en-têtes de réponse. Vérifiez pour chaque réponse la présence de l'en-tête X-XSS-Protection avec la valeur exacte 1; mode=block. Signalez toute page où l'en-tête est absent, désactivé (0), ou dont la valeur ne correspond pas strictement à 1; mode=block.	kimi-k2.6	[0.012420654,0.020050049,-0.03253174,-0.059539795,-0.00944519,-0.032440186,-0.049224854,-0.014205933,-0.00047922134,0.009147644,0.03765869,-0.026885986,-0.014778137,-0.006828308,0.00076150894,0.0065345764,0.012802124,0.014976501,-0.0043754578,-0.0013866425,0.07080078,-0.020950317,-0.021896362,0.009986877,0.012687683,-0.025390625,0.015731812,-0.01108551,0.052001953,-0.0002810955,0.027648926,-0.038726807,0.010978699,0.018615723,0.018493652,-0.034240723,0.012901306,-0.010055542,0.008995056,0.004207611,0.02079773,0.009033203,-0.0045280457,0.014015198,-0.035308838,-0.02192688,-0.027175903,-0.045166016,-0.0079574585,0.016693115,0.009155273,0.020065308,-0.0048294067,0.051452637,-0.05517578,-0.016021729,-0.032562256,0.031082153,-0.026306152,0.01096344,0.01461792,0.002653122,-0.045440674,0.005016327,0.008277893,0.036712646,-0.03503418,-0.010543823,0.021316528,0.014923096,0.00605011,0.0015678406,0.033111572,-0.012992859,0.0135269165,-0.047454834,-0.015472412,0.020309448,0.004711151,-0.003967285,-0.013587952,-0.0015144348,-0.06567383,-0.026535034,-0.0048446655,-0.0