212	12	212	Un mécanisme de sécurité restreint l'origine des contenus.	Activer l’en-tête HTTP Content-Security-Policy avec les directives CSP 1 appropriées :\nimg-src pour les images ;script-src pour le JavaScript ;style-src pour les styles CSS ;font-src pour les webfonts ;etc.	Vérifier, à l’aide d’un outil d’inspection des en-têtes HTTP, la présence de l’en-tête Content-Security-Policy.	statique	La présence et la valeur de l'en-tête HTTP Content-Security-Policy sont directement lisibles dans la réponse du serveur sans nécessiter d'exécution JavaScript ni d'interaction utilisateur.	ia_import	\N	Interrogez un échantillon représentatif de pages du site et examinez les en-têtes de réponse HTTP de chaque requête principale. Vérifiez que l'en-tête Content-Security-Policy est présent et non vide. Signalez l'absence de cet en-tête ou une valeur vide comme non-conformité.	kimi-k2.6	[0.016525269,0.045440674,-0.035369873,-0.04336548,-0.002817154,-0.03643799,-0.055114746,-0.019363403,-0.024017334,0.047088623,0.068847656,-0.021697998,-0.029205322,-0.017623901,-0.015602112,-0.012504578,-0.003982544,-0.0014123917,0.017822266,-0.0023612976,0.057159424,-0.022842407,-0.029464722,0.032196045,0.0025100708,-0.048797607,0.027236938,-0.009315491,0.032470703,-0.01675415,0.047668457,-0.039093018,0.008483887,0.013793945,0.024856567,-0.027313232,0.029907227,-0.011817932,0.01637268,0.016403198,0.00076818466,0.00077676773,0.009254456,-0.0016336441,-0.02999878,0.0028514862,0.011871338,-0.035003662,0.0030117035,0.018112183,0.0038013458,-0.0020523071,0.02758789,0.04510498,-0.044677734,-0.0021400452,-0.047698975,0.029251099,-0.020523071,0.0041503906,0.0236969,-0.0019760132,-0.05557251,0.033081055,0.0054512024,0.027069092,0.0030326843,-0.03173828,0.034820557,0.02217102,0.007545471,0.01651001,-0.001876831,-0.04046631,-0.0040283203,-0.040100098,0.011550903,0.020431519,-0.033203125,-0.021652222,0.022384644,-0.0035572052,-0.033843994,-0.00869751,-0.020568848,-0.022888184,-0.06365967,0.043029785,-0.02848